n><button class="h-10 w-[200px] flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full border bg-white border-[#8B91FF] text-[#555CD6]"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>공개 중⌄</button></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 min-h-0"><aside id="plannerImport" class="w-[340px] shrink-0 flex flex-col bg-gray-50 border-r border-gray-100"><div class="px-4 py-3 bg-white border-b border-gray-100"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2"><h2 class="font-bold text-sm text-gray-800">📋 일정 가져오기</h2><span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400">3개</span></div><div class="relative"><input placeholder="지역, 내용 검색..." class="w-full pl-3 pr-7 py-2 text-xs bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg outline-none"></div><div class="mt-2 flex gap-2 text-[10px] text-gray-400"><span>☷ 전체</span><span>·</span><span>D# = 1일</span><span>·</span><span>항목 = 단일</span></div></div><div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-3 flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="bg-white border border-[#D1D2F9] rounded-xl p-3 shadow-sm cursor-grab"><div class="flex items-start gap-2"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540959733332-eab4deabeeaf?w=300&q=80" class="w-16 h-14 rounded-lg object-cover"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="text-[10px] text-[#6369D1] font-bold">일본 · 도쿄</div><h3 class="text-xs font-black mt-0.5">도쿄 벚꽃 시즌 4박 5일</h3><p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1">맛집과 벚꽃 명소 중심</p></div></div><div class="mt-2 flex gap-1"><span class="text-[9px] bg-gray-100 rounded px-1.5 py-1">D1</span><span class="text-[9px] bg-gray-100 rounded px-1.5 py-1">D2</span><span class="text-[9px] bg-gray-100 rounded px-1.5 py-1">D3</span></div></div><div class="bg-white border border-[#D1D2F9] rounded-xl p-3 shadow-sm cursor-grab"><div class="flex items-start gap-2"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1598273220616-9ee3ab1b5ddd?w=300&q=80" class="w-16 h-14 rounded-lg object-cover"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="text-[10px] text-[#6369D1] font-bold">한국 · 제주</div><h